Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:04.50,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Dear, we've got mail from Rinko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:07.87,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,Master Kunon passed the \Nexam with flying colors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:11.82,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,and was placed in the advanced class, \Nthe highest class in the magic school!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.76,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:15.11,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,That's our Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:20.17,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,He sort of overdid the exam and \Npainted the school yard red.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:23.37,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,But he got into the advanced \Nclass, so all is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:27.98,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,He's called Kunon Gurion of the sea \Nof blood incident, or a troublemaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:32.01,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,but it's the fruit of Master \NKunon's talent! It's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:33.31,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,It's not all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:35.80,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,It's unacceptable to cause such \Nproblems right after enrollment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:38.18,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,As a punishment, I'm not \Nsending money for a month!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.27,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Dear, that's too cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:44.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Allowances are forbidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:48.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay! That's how the magic school does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:50.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:52.96,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:57.39,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Are you saying advanced students \Nare supposed to make their own living?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:00:59.46,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Yes, that's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.66,0:01:03.19,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I cannot accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:38.88,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE SAINT'S FINANCIAL PROBLEM
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:38.89,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Is there a problem, Reyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:42.24,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I came here to learn magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:45.51,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I have no time to figure \Nout how to make ends meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:50.45,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,You're in the advanced class, where \Nwe foster top-tier sorcerers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.45,0:02:55.83,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,and one of the conditions for being \Ntop-tier is being able to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:58.15,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Shall I break it down for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:03.46,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,If you can't make money on your own, \Nyou'll never be top-tier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.92,main,HANK,0,0,0,,One and a half million necca a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.42,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,That's your living expenses?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:18.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A lady needs money to \Ninvest in herself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:22.43,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I have two maids who double as my guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:26.06,main,REYES,0,0,0,,So on top of my living expenses, \NI need to pay their salaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.43,0:03:27.77,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:28.77,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:31.07,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I haven't the faintest idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.85,0:03:35.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,An individual research lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:41.03,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Yes, every student in the advanced \Nclass is assigned a lab room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.36,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:45.49,main,REYES,0,0,0,,And you want us to pay for this, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:48.07,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,The use of the lab is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:52.37,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,You're responsible for the medicine \Nand books for your research, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.95,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,You're free to study hard or slack off,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.95,0:04:02.88,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,but if you don't earn enough credits, \Nyou'll be demoted to the Second Level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:04.39,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Credits?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.53,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Credits are earned for \Nexperiments and achievements in magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:11.29,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,The achievements acknowledged by the \Nprofessors will be awarded credits,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.64,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,and they affect your promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:16.15,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Good luck on your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'm pretty sure I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:21.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My master and I have made \Nquite a bit of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:23.78,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,With Zeon? Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:27.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,He didn't even pay me part-time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:32.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My master found his job as a magical \Nengineer at this school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:37.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How lucky is he to have found \Na job for life in magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:41.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've dreamed of working in the field \Nof magic since I was small, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:46.18,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Wow. I didn't expect you to be \Nso serious about your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right? Right? Aren't I amazing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:51.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Listen, what kind of jobs \Nwill you do with light magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm so interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, \Ntell me about it after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:57.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can take us to a really \Ngreat magic parfait shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:04:59.05,main,REYES,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:05.70,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon! Dinner is ready... oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.64,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You're making me jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:12.49,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Can I have one in my room, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:15.96,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Did something happen at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:19.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The saint always turns me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:23.17,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,That won't do, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:24.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What won't do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.85,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:28.84,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You don't want to be pushy with girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:32.53,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,A gentleman respects a lady's \Nwishes more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:34.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.35,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,And you shouldn't be alone with a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:39.22,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,It causes unnecessary misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.74,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:43.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I do. I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:46.85,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,I have to nudge him \Ntowards the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:50.13,main - italics,RINKO/I,0,0,0,,My sister's idea of a gentleman \Nis kind of skewed, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:52.05,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:56.96,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,will you be able to make money yourself \Nsince you can't get an allowance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:01.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm sure I can pay \Nyour salary just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:04.89,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:19.38,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,I asked the school and confirmed you \Nare not allowed to receive support
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.25,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,from the Holy Kingdom or donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.80,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Just like the guidelines said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:29.18,main,REYES,0,0,0,,They said one is forbidden from receiving \Nmoney and goods from any party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:33.54,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,I don't need to get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.85,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Are you sure? That would be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.50,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,Sorry, I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.73,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:42.13,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:46.99,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,Your healing magic can't be \Nused for business purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.90,main,REYES,0,0,0,,One and a half million necca.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:06:59.74,main,REYES,0,0,0,,One and a half million...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:07.27,main,REYES,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.71,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Oh, Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.01,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Kunon started a business,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.06,main,HANK,0,0,0,,and it was an instant hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:17.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You'd like a 60-minute course?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.36,main,STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Yes. I pulled an all-nighter \Nfor an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.82,main,STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Can I really get deep sleep here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:24.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:28.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will personally guarantee \Nyou a well-rested time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:29.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well then, let us go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:33.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,to the secret flower garden for \Nyou and me and a few other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:47.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but all the slots are full, \Nso please wait for about 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:53.49,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,This is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.34,main,STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,I-I can't do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:57.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thirty more minutes until\N the flower garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:01.54,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,What in the world did you start here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:03.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A Sleep Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:05.29,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:15.25,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,It's true. The person who just \Nwent in is already sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.93,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What are those beds?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:20.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,They're water beds I \Ncreated with my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:23.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's the only thing my master \Nacknowledged and complimented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:25.81,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Zeon, giving a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:26.69,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.00,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Making sleep a business...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.65,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I never thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:34.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Once you start experiments or research,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:36.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,you get sucked in and pull \Nall-nighters, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:41.68,main - flashback,ZEON DOLL,0,0,0,,Huh? Master, the sky is \Nsomehow getting lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:44.09,main - flashback,ZEONLY DOLL,0,0,0,,You idiot, it's called a white night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:46.28,main - flashback,KUNON DOLL,0,0,0,,Okay, it's not like we \Nstayed up all night,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:48.29,main - flashback,KUNON DOLL,0,0,0,,so it's fine for us to continue, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:51.34,main - flashback,ZEONLY DOLL,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I'm sure it'll be \Na white night tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:53.97,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,You two must go to sleep already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:58.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So I figured I could \Noffer them a nice, brief nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:02.11,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Your request for an additional \Nlab space is granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:04.23,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,so make this available\Nto professors, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:06.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But charging professors feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:07.96,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.86,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Because there are tons \Nof people like that here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.88,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MISS A FROM FIRST LEVEL
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.88,main,STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,It ruins you with comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:32.88,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MR. B FROM SECOND LEVEL
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:32.88,main,STUDENT 4,0,0,0,,I feel refreshed, as if I slept half \Na day with only a 60-minute nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:36.13,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,MR. C, WITH 25 YEARS \NOF TEACHING EXPERIENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:36.13,main,PROFESSOR 1,0,0,0,,Two, even three nights of no sleep \Nfeels like just one all-nighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Enjoy your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.66,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,The 60-minute course, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:47.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you. Is this your first time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:53.45,main - italics,BEATTIE/I,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:58.62,main - italics,CICELY/I,0,0,0,,Zeonly's student.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:09.15,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Life is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:13.40,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,Saint Reyes, if I may \Noffer a suggestion...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:16.30,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,Why don't you discuss \Nit with your teachers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.17,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.05,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:24.42,main,REYES,0,0,0,,They suggested that I should \Nask Kunon Gurion for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:27.38,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,A boyfriend who hits on you, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:28.75,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,You're so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.40,main,REYES,0,0,0,,He's just a classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:33.77,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,Oh? And what do your other classmates say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:39.03,main,REYES,0,0,0,,They said it'd be best to ask \Nfor advice from Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:48.06,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Why should I ask for advice \Nfrom someone so frivolous?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:57.85,main,REYES,0,0,0,,If I have to name the emotion \NI'm feeling right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:01.72,main,REYES,0,0,0,,this must be humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You want my advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:04.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm ready to listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:08.80,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Personally, I never wanted to rely on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:13.11,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Who knows what you will \Nask of me in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.33,0:11:16.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A gentleman would never prey \Non a lady's vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:17.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You just owe me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:20.74,main,REYES,0,0,0,,And I'd rather not owe you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:25.49,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Anyhow, here's my situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:26.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:30.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Before you begin, can you \Ncall Professor Sayfie here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:34.38,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,That was an appropriate decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you, Professor Sayfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:40.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I thought, as a gentleman, I should \Navoid being alone with a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:42.88,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I heard about your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:50.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You have no way of making \Nmoney, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:51.86,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:54.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How about healing wounds with your magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:56.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That would surely make you a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:04.30,main,REYES,0,0,0,,My healing magic is a holy power \Nbestowed from my ancestors and god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.91,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I can't use it to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:10.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If that's not a possibility, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:16.54,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Spell verification and \Narchival reports of experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:21.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. There are sorcerers who \Nwant to buy these as data.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But coming from us, the new \Nstudents at this school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:27.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,our work may not be as valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:31.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You can't use healing magic and \Nhave no capital for a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Learning the know-how takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How about purification magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:40.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Can you use that for products?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:42.07,main,REYES,0,0,0,,That's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:46.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then would you like to create \Nand sell magic tools with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.14,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Magic tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:49.45,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:51.96,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,A hit with a magic tool is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.15,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,If your product sells well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:56.46,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,there are bound to be problems \Nif you share the rights to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:13:00.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Ms. Reyes is the lead, even though\N we'll be creating it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,She's in need of money right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,so let's not worry about what happens \Nafter we create the magic tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:08.80,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you're okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So? Would you like to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:15.06,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:18.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Great! Light magic experiments!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hello, Professor Sureyya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:27.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your skin is so plump and \Nsmooth, just like an icy road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.44,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,It's thanks to that water bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:36.96,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,My fatigue is gone, and my skin looks \Ngood. Now I know why it's been so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:40.46,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,This professor... is a light sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:44.09,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,You must be the rumored saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:49.49,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Sureyya Gaulin, \Na professor with the light attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:53.07,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Reyes Saint-Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:56.60,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Thank you for escorting them, \NProfessor Sureyya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.38,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:03.61,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Here's what you've asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:05.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:10.12,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Seeds of shi-shilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:13.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. The sacred herb, shi-shilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:15.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We're going to grow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:16.50,main,REYES,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:20.48,main,REYES,0,0,0,,The sacred herb shi-shilla can \Nonly grow in holy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:21.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's what I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:25.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I did some research on sacred \Nherbs and holy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:28.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Holy land is a place imbued \Nwith holy magic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:31.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and purification power, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.87,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I've been to a holy land once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:37.85,main,REYES,0,0,0,,The land was purified by \N holy magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:40.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.35,main,REYES,0,0,0,,What's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:44.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You can use purification \Nmagic for business, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So I'm wondering if we can \Nartificially create holy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:50.41,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Create holy land?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.65,0:14:52.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The personal spell of the saint, Sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That might do the trick, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:56.34,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Using Sanctum?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:15:02.03,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,A holy barrier created by Sanctum will \Nreproduce the state of holy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:06.10,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,There are records that \Ndocument their similarities,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:08.69,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,so I think it is worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:12.73,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,That's what Kunon came \Nto talk to me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:14.93,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,I'm extremely intrigued!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,All right, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.81,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.85,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Oh wow! Oh wow! Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:02.99,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes! Sprouts of shi-shilla!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:07.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Incredible! I must write down \Neverything that just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:10.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Amazing! A barrier of light magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:13.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh my, one book won't be \Nenough to document this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:17.87,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,So he gets like this \Nwhen it comes to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:23.86,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,He actually wanted to experiment, \Nso he really wasn't hitting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:28.27,main,REYES,0,0,0,,And what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:29.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Wanna go out for some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's fine too, but I'd \Nrather have lunch with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:34.59,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,So he is hitting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:36.26,main,REYES,0,0,0,,About the sacred herb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:38.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,We process it to make medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:41.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sacred herb shi-shilla \Nis rare and expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:45.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If we succeed, making 1.5 \Nmillion necca isn't a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:50.71,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,This is worth 1.5 million necca?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:54.65,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,I gave it a lot of thought \Nand came up with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:58.92,main - italics,REYES/I,0,0,0,,But he came up with a way to make \Nmoney with magic in such a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Were you admiring my profile?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.28,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Did you fall for me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:06.19,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I wasn't admiring you to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:12.10,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,I'm glad your one million necca \Ndidn't go to waste, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.10,0:17:12.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:14.90,main,REYES,0,0,0,,What was the money for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.66,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,The price of these seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:20.30,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,One seed is 200,000 necca, so the \Ntotal was one million necca.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:23.83,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,You pay for what you use in your \Nmagic experiments, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.55,main,REYES,0,0,0,,But I don't have that kind of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:26.94,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,It's for Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.37,0:17:29.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But the deal was that they'd be free with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:33.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,the success of the cultivation of the \Nherb and the report on its growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:38.28,main,REYES,0,0,0,,If it didn't succeed, \Nwere you going to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:41.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So I'm glad it was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you. You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:57.58,main,REYES,0,0,0,,If I have to define what I'm feeling \Nright now, I think I'm feeling sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.94,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I caused you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:02.07,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:06.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd rather hear "thank \Nyou" than "I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I prefer that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:12.97,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:15.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Did you fall for me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.56,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I've never fallen for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.52,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.54,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Oh my, oh my, oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.25,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:34.92,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Grind the petals, mix in \Nthe dried iyo grass, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.82,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,This is almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:40.43,main,SUREYYA,0,0,0,,Now you can finish up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:43.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-rubu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:09.65,main,ASAND,0,0,0,,These are unmistakably pills of \Nsacred herb shi-shilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:16.46,main,ASAND,0,0,0,,At this purity, they're worth \N1.5... No, 2 million necca.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:24.56,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,So much food. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:27.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's to celebrate closing the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.45,0:19:32.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's a gentleman's joy to dedicate \Nhis wallet to attractive ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:34.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please order whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:37.79,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,Master Kunon Gurion. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.79,0:19:39.86,main,JIRNI,0,0,0,,Now we can get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:43.59,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,And you negotiated a long-term \Ncontract with the guild for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.59,0:19:45.62,main,PHILEA,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:48.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I got to write a report on light magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:51.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,not to mention have lunch \Nwith you, so I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.37,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:54.77,main,KUNON/REYES/JIRNI/PHILEA,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:03.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That lunch was 220,000 necca.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:08.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I heard they had to starve themselves \Nfor a while, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:10.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Especially the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:15.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Those maids drank the vintage wine \Nworth 20,000 necca like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:22.01,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Even if it's for ladies, I should learn \Nnot to say, "Order whatever you want."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:25.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, I learned a good lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.08,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Hey, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:34.10,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,How did Reyes's medicine go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.29,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It went very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Except for the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What are you two up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:42.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You want a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:48.08,main,HANK,0,0,0,,No. Actually, we're not really \Nsure where to begin ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.08,0:20:49.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:51.23,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Wait, that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:54.21,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Kunon, can I ask for your advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:58.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you were ladies, I would've \Ndone everything in my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:01.03,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.07,0:21:06.36,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then will you help with my ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.87,0:21:11.08,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like you to make \Nbacon I can eat, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:11.98,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Bacon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:13.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I want Riyah to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:14.83,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.83,0:21:16.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:30.68,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,I slept so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:33.68,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,This is a sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:37.46,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:40.06,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0} doing? Nothing better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:42.85,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,No way. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:47.36,main - italics,ARIANE/I,0,0,0,,Gathering information, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:49.56,main - italics,BEATTIE/I,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're here for the same reason.
